# The car journey: a scripted walk through one live conversation, played on the real brain. Never a replay.
# One step per line. A step may be named, `name: step`, so a film editor can find it in the timings.
#   type | <prompt>                 type it into the real box, letter by letter (about 12 a second), and send
#   tap | <visible label>           a choice, a control, or a label the brain drew on a part (a callout, a figure's label), found by its words: "Brakes" taps "brake disc"
#                                   (tap? | ... skips the step when it never shows). `Brakes / Brake / Wheels` lists alternatives: the first one on stage is tapped,
#                                   and the timings say which. Words that cannot be tapped (a line of speech, a figure's description) are never tapped.
#   drag <control id or label> <from> > <to> over=<s>   (min and max stand for the ends of the slider)
#                                   work a slider by its knob (drag? skips it when there is no such control)
#   undo                            the Undo chip
#   back                            a Back choice when the brain offers one, else the Undo chip
#   hold <s>                        look at the stage for a while
#   rest                            wait until the turn has ended, the stage is still and any repair is done or skipped
# A line that starts with # is a note.

# five seconds of idle screen before the first key
hold 5
car: type | Show me the main parts of a car
rest
hold 4
# the brain draws what it likes, and what it labels can be tapped: "Brakes" is the closest label ("brake disc", "brakes"); a part it did not label is skipped after a few seconds, and said so in the timings
brakes: tap? | Brakes / Brake / Wheels / Wheel
rest
hold 4
stop: type | How far does it take to stop? Let me change the speed.
rest
hold 4
dragSpeed: drag speed 50 > 100 over=4
hold 4
back: back
rest
hold 4
engine: tap? | Engine / Motor
rest
hold 2
dragEngine: drag? engine min > max over=3
hold 4
diesel: type | What's different in a diesel?
rest
hold 4
how: type | Show me how you're doing this
rest
hold 4
